Problem Transformation

        What is this problem secretly equivalent to?

        Example
              Word Ladder

        How
            Transform: words + one-letter transitions
            Graph problem, BFS shortest path

        Fails when
            Problem requires combining multiple abstractions/models together
            Example
              Hard DP + Greedy + Graph hybrid problems


Correctly modeling the problem becomes the main skill, because once transformed, solution often becomes standard.

Even correct transformation is insufficient, because multiple interacting abstractions must be balanced simultaneously.

        
